.jpg\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rr2eXETcEe4", "nc": 186, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ebb_ss/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2103584, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9f57143e/uploads/origins/00bf4b80-7c58-4352-bb44-032f99315a71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d515fc573b35f9ca5003fb27ce2f70a8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f57143e/uploads/origins/00bf4b80-7c58-4352-bb44-032f99315a71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d515fc573b35f9ca5003fb27ce2f70a8, https://si.imgix.net/9f57143e/uploads/origins/00bf4b80-7c58-4352-bb44-032f99315a71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b80452a9b9470620f36d0021fa37975 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9f57143e/uploads/origins/00bf4b80-7c58-4352-bb44-032f99315a71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=796c85be960244eb89ac7ead12b8f1da 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9f57143e/uploads/origins/00bf4b80-7c58-4352-bb44-032f99315a71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=008fd126659520c68b75df7828fcf5cb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f57143e/uploads/origins/00bf4b80-7c58-4352-bb44-032f99315a71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=008fd126659520c68b75df7828fcf5cb, https://si.imgix.net/9f57143e/uploads/origins/00bf4b80-7c58-4352-bb44-032f99315a71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=39ae5d470a96d027fa51b3262b2df3ef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9f57143e/uploads/origins/00bf4b80-7c58-4352-bb44-032f99315a71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2a6719df90e060f7ae84aab692bf3aba 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは。さっそくですが桜坂しずくちゃんをお願いします。\n第一希望は、しずくちゃんがモブ男の乳首をペロッと舐めて、もう一つの乳首を指でつまんでる絵です。\n第二希望は、しずくちゃんの乳首舐め手コキです。\nお好きな方をお選びください。\nこれらはいわゆる「園田スペシャル構図」というやつで、Skebやpixivで「園田スペシャル」で検索するとそういうものが沢山出てきます。\n男の主観の構図でも第三者の視点でもどちらでもかまいません。\n「ふふっ💛ニジガクスペシャルです！」というセリフを付けてください。\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/86303642\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/100570656\nそしてさらにお手数ですが、右上にカットインで唐可可ちゃんが「ああっ！あれは園田流！！」と驚いている顔を付け加えてください。\nカットインの例は以下の通りとなります。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@nigai_58/works/2\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/99371096\n以上です。よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 346742, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "TAC", "screen_name": "TAC_SNS", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1939669901980889088/Rt6OgswZ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1178909771992166400/1731756185/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 472714, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "sumari@Skeb募集中", "screen_name": "sumari_r18", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1829630753044643844/1kLq4dSi.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/969594592944316417/1772951953/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "video"}], "nc": 161}, {"id": 516014, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "エミル@アンナ", "scre